# ACL for the anonymous websocket listener (9001) -- browser dashboard only.
# Anonymous clients may read, never publish, so WiFi clients cannot inject
# alarm commands or spoof sensor data.
#
# Narrowed from "read RVC/#" on 2026-10-27. That wildcard granted every
# anonymous client on Sophie's WiFi the entire RV-C stream: tank levels,
# battery state, charger, solar, tire pressures. Exactly one thing consumes
# this listener -- AlertsPanel.jsx, which subscribes to RVC/SYS_ERRORS and
# nothing else -- so the wildcard was giving away everything to buy nothing.
#
# If a future panel needs another topic over websockets, add it here
# explicitly rather than widening this back to a wildcard.
topic read RVC/SYS_ERRORS
